  "notes": [
    "**Divertir** is a stem-changing verb: e→ie in present, e→i in preterite",
    "Present: stem change e→ie (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: stem change e→i in 3rd person forms (divirtió, divirtieron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **divertido**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Almost always used reflexively: **divertirse** (to have fun, to enjoy oneself)",
    "Reflexive forms: *me divierto, te diviertes, se divierte, nos divertimos, se divierten*",
    "Common usage: *Me divertí mucho* (I had a lot of fun), *¿Te diviertes?* (Are you having fun?)",
    "Related adjective: **divertido/a** (fun, amusing, entertaining)",
    "Same pattern as **sentir** and **preferir**"
  ],
